1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

2
00:01:32,890 --> 00:01:34,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[creaking]</b></font>

3
00:01:36,390 --> 00:01:37,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau exhales]</b></font>

4
00:01:44,810 --> 00:01:46,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunting]</b></font>

5
00:02:15,590 --> 00:02:18,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] As I thought,
a challenge, indeed.</b></font>

6
00:02:20,930 --> 00:02:22,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's as if we're fighting</b></font>

7
00:02:22,180 --> 00:02:24,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>multiple master swordsmen
at once.</b></font>

8
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:27,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>On top of the sheer number
of attacks,</b></font>

9
00:02:27,770 --> 00:02:31,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>his reflexes and stamina
far exceed those of any man.</b></font>

10
00:02:32,110 --> 00:02:33,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's overpowering Stark.</b></font>

11
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:35,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If this becomes
a battle of endurance,</b></font>

12
00:02:36,030 --> 00:02:37,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-we are sure to lose.
-[Stark grunts]</b></font>

13
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:41,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Should we retreat
and regroup?</b></font>

14
00:02:41,750 --> 00:02:42,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No.</b></font>

15
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:45,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's faster than us.</b></font>

16
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:46,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He would chase us down.</b></font>

17
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:51,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] This is bad.
Frieren was right.</b></font>

18
00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:53,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't read his attacks.</b></font>

19
00:02:55,050 --> 00:02:56,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only one option.</b></font>

20
00:03:01,020 --> 00:03:02,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] That fool...</b></font>

21
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:04,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I told him to deflect
his attacks.</b></font>

22
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:06,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are mine.</b></font>

23
00:03:07,730 --> 00:03:10,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU]
He took the hit intentionally?</b></font>

24
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tough young man.</b></font>

25
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:19,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am impressed.</b></font>

26
00:03:19,410 --> 00:03:21,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are far sharper
than I supposed.</b></font>

27
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:25,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be it slight, you created
just the opening I need.</b></font>

28
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:36,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's over, Revolte.</b></font>

29
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course, I remember you.</b></font>

30
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:41,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How could I ever forget</b></font>

31
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:44,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the partner of the last
first-class mage I slaughtered?</b></font>

32
00:03:45,350 --> 00:03:48,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The situation was similar
to this one, no?</b></font>

33
00:03:48,190 --> 00:03:50,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You bravely ventured forth
to slay my allies</b></font>

34
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:53,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>while your partner defended
the village.</b></font>

35
00:03:54,740 --> 00:03:57,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>By the time that you returned
from your path of glory,</b></font>

36
00:03:57,450 --> 00:03:59,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there was absolutely nothing
you could do for him.</b></font>

37
00:04:00,660 --> 00:04:03,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't you want to know
how your partner died?</b></font>

38
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:04,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Silence.</b></font>

39
00:04:04,950 --> 00:04:07,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I should thank your
fallen colleague for teaching me</b></font>

40
00:04:07,410 --> 00:04:09,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a valuable lesson
about mankind.</b></font>

41
00:04:09,460 --> 00:04:13,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine, then.
I will silence you myself.</b></font>

42
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:16,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In that case,
allow me to grant you</b></font>

43
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:18,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a final piece of advice.</b></font>

44
00:04:18,630 --> 00:04:20,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Search the wreckage
more carefully,</b></font>

45
00:04:20,390 --> 00:04:22,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you may well find a survivor.</b></font>

46
00:04:24,430 --> 00:04:25,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] A child?</b></font>

47
00:04:32,310 --> 00:04:33,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Enjoy your last breaths.</b></font>

48
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:39,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau grunts softly]</b></font>

49
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:47,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau thuds]</b></font>

50
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JUNG] I did it!</b></font>

51
00:04:48,410 --> 00:04:52,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you see me get him,
Lord Revolte? Praise me!</b></font>

52
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:59,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE] Well done.
You have my thanks.</b></font>

53
00:05:00,590 --> 00:05:02,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU]
My judgment was clouded.</b></font>

54
00:05:02,550 --> 00:05:05,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My mind's eye focused
on memories of him.</b></font>

55
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:08,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There couldn't have been
a child.</b></font>

56
00:05:08,350 --> 00:05:10,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That much
should've been obvious.</b></font>

57
00:05:12,730 --> 00:05:15,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is just as your partner
illustrated for me.</b></font>

58
00:05:15,820 --> 00:05:19,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Humans will protect their young
no matter what it may cost.</b></font>

59
00:05:19,740 --> 00:05:20,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau chuckles]</b></font>

60
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:22,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Don't be so certain.</b></font>

61
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:24,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If that were true,</b></font>

62
00:05:24,830 --> 00:05:27,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there would be much more light
in the world</b></font>

63
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than I see today.</b></font>

64
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:32,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't crossed paths
with many fools willing to die</b></font>

65
00:05:32,330 --> 00:05:34,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>protecting children
they've never met.</b></font>

66
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:36,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've only known one.</b></font>

67
00:05:39,550 --> 00:05:41,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems he was a kind boy.</b></font>

68
00:05:41,420 --> 00:05:43,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would wager
that was his undoing.</b></font>

69
00:05:43,930 --> 00:05:45,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's the same in every era.</b></font>

70
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:49,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kind mages always lead
the shortest lives.</b></font>

71
00:05:49,930 --> 00:05:52,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU]
He met a magnificent end.</b></font>

72
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

73
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:57,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERIE] So even you can speak
empty words.</b></font>

74
00:05:58,030 --> 00:06:01,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Genau, you're an unpleasant man.</b></font>

75
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:04,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't possess
a grain of kindness.</b></font>

76
00:06:08,370 --> 00:06:10,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Never change that.</b></font>

77
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:14,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As you command.</b></font>

78
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:19,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE] Though killing
brings me no great pleasure...</b></font>

79
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:22,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I shall end your misery.</b></font>

80
00:06:23,010 --> 00:06:24,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau scoffs]</b></font>

81
00:06:24,300 --> 00:06:25,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To think my final act</b></font>

82
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:28,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was one so horribly
out of character.</b></font>

83
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunting]</b></font>

84
00:06:37,230 --> 00:06:38,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE] Gracious.</b></font>

85
00:06:39,270 --> 00:06:40,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have faced many a warrior,</b></font>

86
00:06:41,030 --> 00:06:42,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and never have I
encountered a foe</b></font>

87
00:06:42,740 --> 00:06:44,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who could withstand
a direct blow</b></font>

88
00:06:44,490 --> 00:06:45,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from one of my blades.</b></font>

89
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:48,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can still move after that?</b></font>

90
00:06:48,370 --> 00:06:51,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You would've been better off
playing dead, you fool.</b></font>

91
00:06:51,830 --> 00:06:54,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Then we would've lost.
[grunts]</b></font>

92
00:06:55,460 --> 00:06:57,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I don't give up so easily!</b></font>

93
00:06:57,380 --> 00:07:00,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The winner of any battle
is the last man standing!</b></font>

94
00:07:01,210 --> 00:07:02,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perhaps you're not
the good person</b></font>

95
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:03,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought you were.</b></font>

96
00:07:03,970 --> 00:07:05,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're simply an idiot.</b></font>

97
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:08,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though I suppose
there is some valor in that.</b></font>

98
00:07:11,350 --> 00:07:14,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let us venture into
the jaws of death as one.</b></font>

99
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:17,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The closer that he brings us
to our demise,</b></font>

100
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:20,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the greater the catharsis
we shall feel when we survive.</b></font>

101
00:07:21,020 --> 00:07:23,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Somethin' to look forward to.</b></font>

102
00:07:23,190 --> 00:07:25,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, let's hurry up
and get there.</b></font>

103
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] What should I do?</b></font>

104
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:46,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Frieren disappeared
at some point.</b></font>

105
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:54,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Getting to watch from afar
every once in a while</b></font>

106
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:55,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is a relaxing treat.</b></font>

107
00:08:09,660 --> 00:08:12,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HEMMUNG] Concealing your mana
will not help you hide.</b></font>

108
00:08:13,990 --> 00:08:17,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I meticulously crafted this fog
with magic of my own.</b></font>

109
00:08:17,790 --> 00:08:19,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It detects
and identifies targets</b></font>

110
00:08:19,710 --> 00:08:21,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the faintest trace
of mana.</b></font>

111
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:23,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Useful,</b></font>

112
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:27,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as no living creature can
conceal their mana completely.</b></font>

113
00:08:35,930 --> 00:08:39,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Visibility is poor,
and he's blocking my attacks.</b></font>

114
00:08:40,230 --> 00:08:42,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's a bad matchup for me.</b></font>

115
00:08:57,750 --> 00:08:59,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE]
I can sense Miss Fern.</b></font>

116
00:08:59,500 --> 00:09:01,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She seems to be
struggling as well.</b></font>

117
00:09:02,330 --> 00:09:03,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's understandable,</b></font>

118
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:07,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>her opponent's magic is
unlike any I have faced before.</b></font>

119
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:08,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Medrozobalt.</b></font>

120
00:09:13,180 --> 00:09:15,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's so important over there?</b></font>

121
00:09:15,180 --> 00:09:16,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your only opponent
right now is me.</b></font>

122
00:09:17,470 --> 00:09:18,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm aware.</b></font>

123
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE]
There is nothing unconventional</b></font>

124
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about this demon's
fighting style.</b></font>

125
00:09:32,950 --> 00:09:35,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Her combat is steady
and technique tried-and-true.</b></font>

126
00:09:35,990 --> 00:09:38,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She defends while she attacks.</b></font>

127
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Her fundamentals are solid.</b></font>

128
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:42,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I cannot find
the slightest opening.</b></font>

129
00:09:42,710 --> 00:09:45,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would be remiss to try
and face her head-on.</b></font>

130
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:52,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In an ideal world,</b></font>

131
00:09:52,550 --> 00:09:54,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miss Fern and I would
work together</b></font>

132
00:09:54,340 --> 00:09:56,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to bring them both down.</b></font>

133
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:58,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's likely this fog has</b></font>

134
00:09:58,310 --> 00:10:00,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>powerful mana-detection
capabilities.</b></font>

135
00:10:01,310 --> 00:10:02,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unfortunate...</b></font>

136
00:10:02,730 --> 00:10:04,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miss Fern's stealth
is her greatest asset</b></font>

137
00:10:04,980 --> 00:10:07,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and she can't use it.
Meaning...</b></font>

138
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:09,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>our situation would
greatly improve</b></font>

139
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:11,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if this fog were removed
from the picture.</b></font>

140
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Time to get a little rough.</b></font>

141
00:10:16,620 --> 00:10:17,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

142
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:29,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SOLIDE] What's this?
Her attack pattern changed.</b></font>

143
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:51,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know this fighting style.</b></font>

144
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:53,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have seen it before.</b></font>

145
00:10:53,490 --> 00:10:55,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>These tactics are similar
to those used</b></font>

146
00:10:55,950 --> 00:10:58,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by a demon hunting clan
who lived on the Plateau.</b></font>

147
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:02,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They dedicated their lives
to massacring my kind.</b></font>

148
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They were insane.</b></font>

149
00:11:04,790 --> 00:11:07,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And it seems you may be, too.</b></font>

150
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:10,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You and I should be
a good match.</b></font>

151
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:13,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now then, let's fight fair.</b></font>

152
00:11:13,050 --> 00:11:14,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Revolte yells]</b></font>

153
00:11:21,310 --> 00:11:24,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Such speed...
I can't land a single spell.</b></font>

154
00:11:26,850 --> 00:11:29,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His movements are no longer
masterful and measured.</b></font>

155
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're savage
and erratic, like those</b></font>

156
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of a mindless predator.
[grunts]</b></font>

157
00:11:36,450 --> 00:11:37,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau chokes]</b></font>

158
00:11:38,620 --> 00:11:40,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Despite the grievous
wounds we dealt,</b></font>

159
00:11:40,950 --> 00:11:42,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he fights on undaunted.</b></font>

160
00:11:42,990 --> 00:11:44,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His resilience is superhuman,</b></font>

161
00:11:44,950 --> 00:11:47,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and his stamina
is seemingly inexhaustible.</b></font>

162
00:11:47,870 --> 00:11:51,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If this keeps drawing on,
he'll beat us by attrition.</b></font>

163
00:11:54,300 --> 00:11:56,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

164
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:00,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Revolte scoffs]</b></font>

165
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:02,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

166
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:03,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

167
00:12:32,630 --> 00:12:33,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Revolte grunts]</b></font>

168
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

169
00:12:47,140 --> 00:12:48,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Genau, his swords!</b></font>

170
00:12:48,730 --> 00:12:51,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If they can fracture,
they can shatter!</b></font>

171
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:52,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They have grown brittle.</b></font>

172
00:12:52,730 --> 00:12:54,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It appears he's
lost the essential focus</b></font>

173
00:12:54,730 --> 00:12:57,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to maintain the mana
his many weapons require.</b></font>

174
00:12:57,860 --> 00:12:59,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just three left!</b></font>

175
00:13:04,490 --> 00:13:06,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SOLIDE] Strange.</b></font>

176
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:08,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What is this dichotomy?</b></font>

177
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:11,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Her attacks
are undoubtedly ferocious,</b></font>

178
00:13:11,330 --> 00:13:13,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I sense no bloodlust
behind them.</b></font>

179
00:13:13,790 --> 00:13:14,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] My...</b></font>

180
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You really are astute.</b></font>

181
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though I fear the speed
of your notice</b></font>

182
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>leaves a lot to be desired.</b></font>

183
00:13:21,470 --> 00:13:24,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've already finished
analyzing this pesky fog.</b></font>

184
00:13:27,390 --> 00:13:29,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When all one knows is warfare,</b></font>

185
00:13:29,310 --> 00:13:32,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the only spells they learn
are those for combat.</b></font>

186
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:34,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Were it any other member
of my clan</b></font>

187
00:13:34,860 --> 00:13:36,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>standing here before you,</b></font>

188
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:38,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you would certainly defeat them,</b></font>

189
00:13:38,610 --> 00:13:41,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for they lack
a fundamental insight.</b></font>

190
00:13:41,450 --> 00:13:43,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Magic is incredibly fun.</b></font>

191
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Methode blows]</b></font>

192
00:13:47,620 --> 00:13:49,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] Erilfrachte.</b></font>

193
00:13:56,670 --> 00:13:58,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HEMMUNG] They cleared the fog.</b></font>

194
00:13:58,670 --> 00:14:00,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How pointless.</b></font>

195
00:14:01,590 --> 00:14:04,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can just as easily
summon it again.</b></font>

196
00:14:09,060 --> 00:14:11,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now where has that girl
run off to?</b></font>

197
00:14:13,770 --> 00:14:15,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

198
00:14:22,990 --> 00:14:24,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SOLIDE]
Hemmung's mana vanished.</b></font>

199
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:26,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

200
00:14:39,300 --> 00:14:41,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SOLIDE] An attack?
Where'd it come from?</b></font>

201
00:14:54,940 --> 00:14:56,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Zoltraak.</b></font>

202
00:15:00,650 --> 00:15:01,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SOLIDE] She's so far!</b></font>

203
00:15:09,530 --> 00:15:10,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Methode chuckles softly]</b></font>

204
00:15:11,790 --> 00:15:14,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] The trajectory
of a long-distance shot</b></font>

205
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from outside the range
of detection</b></font>

206
00:15:15,910 --> 00:15:17,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>cannot be predicted.</b></font>

207
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:20,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Impressive. Truly.</b></font>

208
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:21,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern sighs]</b></font>

209
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:26,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd really rather not fight
such a difficult fight again.</b></font>

210
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:28,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

211
00:15:33,140 --> 00:15:35,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Revolte yelling]</b></font>

212
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:36,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunting]</b></font>

213
00:15:36,140 --> 00:15:37,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just two more left to go!</b></font>

214
00:15:38,610 --> 00:15:39,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Revolte grunts]</b></font>

215
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:41,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] One!</b></font>

216
00:15:42,110 --> 00:15:43,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Revolte yelling]</b></font>

217
00:15:46,570 --> 00:15:48,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark yells]</b></font>

218
00:15:50,580 --> 00:15:53,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're disarmed. It's done.</b></font>

219
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:03,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only humans would see
empty hands as harmless</b></font>

220
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when they're weapons
just the same.</b></font>

221
00:16:06,130 --> 00:16:09,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your fatal assumption was
to believe me rendered blunted</b></font>

222
00:16:09,050 --> 00:16:10,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without the boon of my blades.</b></font>

223
00:16:11,140 --> 00:16:13,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now victory is mine.</b></font>

224
00:16:14,220 --> 00:16:15,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Fatal assumption.</b></font>

225
00:16:15,890 --> 00:16:17,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think you'll find
both our species</b></font>

226
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:19,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are capable of those.</b></font>

227
00:16:19,730 --> 00:16:23,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You clearly have no idea
how tenacious my kind can be.</b></font>

228
00:16:23,980 --> 00:16:24,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REVOLTE] Huh?</b></font>

229
00:16:24,940 --> 00:16:26,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

230
00:16:28,860 --> 00:16:29,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Revolte gasps]</b></font>

231
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:37,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Cleaving Light!</b></font>

232
00:16:41,460 --> 00:16:42,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Revolte grunts]</b></font>

233
00:16:43,130 --> 00:16:45,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Revolte yells]
-Now, Digardnacht.</b></font>

234
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:05,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] For what it's worth,</b></font>

235
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:07,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you seem like
a good person to me, too.</b></font>

236
00:17:08,530 --> 00:17:10,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're still trying
to defend the village,</b></font>

237
00:17:10,660 --> 00:17:12,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even after it's been destroyed.</b></font>

238
00:17:13,570 --> 00:17:15,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I couldn't do that.</b></font>

239
00:17:18,290 --> 00:17:20,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

240
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:30,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There, see?</b></font>

241
00:17:31,010 --> 00:17:33,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're still here
trying to save me.</b></font>

242
00:17:37,470 --> 00:17:39,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I knew it.</b></font>

243
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:42,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're a good guy after all.</b></font>

244
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:44,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau groans]</b></font>

245
00:17:44,730 --> 00:17:45,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

246
00:17:46,770 --> 00:17:49,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathing heavily]</b></font>

247
00:17:53,910 --> 00:17:56,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[straining]</b></font>

248
00:18:15,930 --> 00:18:17,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We live to meet again.</b></font>

249
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:21,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I really am incapable
of dying properly, aren't I?</b></font>

250
00:18:21,310 --> 00:18:23,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It would seem that way.</b></font>

251
00:18:23,810 --> 00:18:26,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Enough, I can move.</b></font>

252
00:18:27,020 --> 00:18:28,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau grunts]</b></font>

253
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:31,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How is Stark?</b></font>

254
00:18:31,570 --> 00:18:33,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] A little worse
for wear maybe.</b></font>

255
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:35,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But he'll live
to fight another day.</b></font>

256
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:40,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When I arrived, I prioritized
healing him over you.</b></font>

257
00:18:43,370 --> 00:18:44,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

258
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:53,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] I see.</b></font>

259
00:18:54,340 --> 00:18:55,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you displeased?</b></font>

260
00:18:55,890 --> 00:18:59,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] No. He conducted himself
surprisingly well.</b></font>

261
00:19:00,850 --> 00:19:02,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you wish to linger,</b></font>

262
00:19:02,220 --> 00:19:04,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miss Frieren's party
will be staying in the village</b></font>

263
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>while he recovers.</b></font>

264
00:19:05,650 --> 00:19:07,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

265
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:27,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Good. I'm practically
back to baseline.</b></font>

266
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:29,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] He's doing push-ups.</b></font>

267
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:31,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's a real marvel of nature.</b></font>

268
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:32,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or perhaps a freak of it.</b></font>

269
00:19:32,960 --> 00:19:34,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're so mean to me.</b></font>

270
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:36,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE]
Miss Frieren, I couldn't help</b></font>

271
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:38,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but notice your party
is lacking a priest.</b></font>

272
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:41,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once this request
draws to a close,</b></font>

273
00:19:41,350 --> 00:19:43,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll have a fair bit
of free time on my hands.</b></font>

274
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could accompany you,
should you wish it.</b></font>

275
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:46,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern gasps]</b></font>

276
00:19:46,770 --> 00:19:49,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Northern Plateau
can prove dangerous</b></font>

277
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:50,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without the spells of a priest.</b></font>

278
00:19:51,270 --> 00:19:52,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, we'll be okay.</b></font>

279
00:19:52,730 --> 00:19:56,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't cast any advanced level
healing magic like you,</b></font>

280
00:19:56,110 --> 00:19:58,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I do know
some lesser priest spells</b></font>

281
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could lean on in a pinch.</b></font>

282
00:20:00,280 --> 00:20:02,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we find ourselves
in serious trouble,</b></font>

283
00:20:02,410 --> 00:20:04,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we can always run away.</b></font>

284
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:05,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's worked pretty well so far.</b></font>

285
00:20:06,830 --> 00:20:08,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Besides, prudent or not,</b></font>

286
00:20:08,420 --> 00:20:11,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think we'd like to keep our
priest slot open for a while.</b></font>

287
00:20:12,210 --> 00:20:15,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You never know
who you might bump into again.</b></font>

288
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:16,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And, well...</b></font>

289
00:20:17,970 --> 00:20:20,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For some reason,
Fern seems unhappy</b></font>

290
00:20:20,050 --> 00:20:21,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>whenever you're around us.</b></font>

291
00:20:21,850 --> 00:20:24,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, goodness. Have I somehow
made her hate me?</b></font>

292
00:20:24,890 --> 00:20:26,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, reciprocated or not,</b></font>

293
00:20:26,810 --> 00:20:28,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I still very much
love you, Miss Fern.</b></font>

294
00:20:28,900 --> 00:20:31,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And that adorably angry face
of yours.</b></font>

295
00:20:32,230 --> 00:20:35,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Methode, the Chivalric Order
of Norm is here.</b></font>

296
00:20:36,110 --> 00:20:37,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're set to depart soon.</b></font>

297
00:20:37,860 --> 00:20:40,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And we'll be accompanying them
back south.</b></font>

298
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:42,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Understood.</b></font>

299
00:20:42,530 --> 00:20:43,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] It would seem</b></font>

300
00:20:43,580 --> 00:20:45,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this is where
we must say goodbye.</b></font>

301
00:20:47,040 --> 00:20:49,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, Stark, how are your wounds?</b></font>

302
00:20:51,210 --> 00:20:53,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Healed and ready
for the next fight!</b></font>

303
00:20:53,170 --> 00:20:54,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I see.</b></font>

304
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:57,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I owe you three a sizable debt.</b></font>

305
00:20:57,970 --> 00:20:59,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One I intend to repay.</b></font>

306
00:20:59,970 --> 00:21:01,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE] Mister Genau.</b></font>

307
00:21:03,550 --> 00:21:04,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Say it.</b></font>

308
00:21:07,930 --> 00:21:10,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Many thanks to you
for all the help.</b></font>

309
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, right back at you.</b></font>

310
00:21:13,020 --> 00:21:14,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>May the both of us
live long lives.</b></font>

311
00:21:14,860 --> 00:21:16,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Genau chuckles]</b></font>

312
00:21:17,070 --> 00:21:19,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[GENAU] Let's go.
-Right.</b></font>

313
00:21:20,110 --> 00:21:21,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take care.</b></font>

314
00:21:21,950 --> 00:21:23,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GENAU] Sure.</b></font>

315
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:25,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Till next we meet.</b></font>

316
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

317
00:21:53,900 --> 00:21:55,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hey,
was it the right move</b></font>

318
00:21:55,820 --> 00:21:57,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to turn that down?</b></font>

319
00:21:58,360 --> 00:22:00,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Methode's priest offer.</b></font>

320
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:03,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The sole priest this party
has a place for is Sein.</b></font>

321
00:22:03,610 --> 00:22:05,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, obviously.</b></font>

322
00:22:05,370 --> 00:22:07,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But she's a pretty older woman.</b></font>

323
00:22:07,120 --> 00:22:08,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't you think
Sein'll complain</b></font>

324
00:22:08,660 --> 00:22:10,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that we didn't bring her along
with us?</b></font>

325
00:22:10,910 --> 00:22:12,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Use your head, Stark.</b></font>

326
00:22:12,790 --> 00:22:15,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This party's "older woman"
spot is already filled.</b></font>

327
00:22:15,840 --> 00:22:17,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark chuckles]</b></font>

328
00:22:17,420 --> 00:22:19,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] How could I forget?</b></font>

329
00:22:19,800 --> 00:22:22,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

330
00:23:49,850 --> 00:23:52,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] I suppose it shall
depend on the reward.</b></font>

331
00:23:52,140 --> 00:23:53,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[overlapping chatter]</b></font>

332
00:23:53,810 --> 00:23:55,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HEITER]
I'm so bored, I could die.</b></font>

333
00:23:55,520 --> 00:23:57,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SAILOR] I've looked up to him
ever since I was a child.</b></font>

334
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:59,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[FERN] What does it say?
-[FRIEREN] " Himmel's memoirs."</b></font>

